{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25558","headline":"六叹 二 · 李涉","name":"六叹 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深院梧桐夹金井，上有辘轳青丝索。\n美人清昼汲寒泉，寒泉欲上银缾落。\n迢迢碧甃千余尺，竟日倚阑空叹息。\n惆怅不来照明镜，却掩洞房抱寂寂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}